  "description": "Insulated Garden Room/ Office ('Oko Pod') installed at the bottom of the garden, out of view of all flats in the building. \n\nThe size will be approximately 3.7m x 2.6m externally with an internal ceiling height of 2.1m \n\nIt will be cladded in Natural Thermowood and will feature 1 x 2446mm sliding (or bifold) double glazed doors with an aluminium frame in black or anthracite grey.\n\nThe internal floor will have a vinyl or laminate finish and external roof will be monarplan single ply membrane. \n\nIt will be heated by an infrared wi-fi controlled radiator. There will be electrics to power 4 x spotlights, 1 x light switch, 2 x Remote controlled external lights and\n2 x Double sockets. There will be 1 x Internet point & Deco Wi-Fi extender\n\nInsulation will be provided by 100mm Thermafleece CosyWool or Sheepswool & Mineral Wool Mix \n\nFoundations provided by an OKOBASE support frame.\n\n(See attached documents for more information)",
  "development_type": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "3 YEAR CONSENT PERIOD:  The development hereby permitted shall be begun not later than the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.\r\n\r\nREASON: To comply with the provisions of Section 91(1)(a) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 as amended by the Planning and Compulsory Purchase Act 2004 (Chapter 5)."
